msgid "Not applicable"
msgstr "Ei kohaldu"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:189
msgid "Not assessed"
msgstr "Hindamata"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:197
msgid "Only the system log was consulted. Without the drive's own report (SMART) it cannot be called healthy."
msgstr "Uuriti ainult süsteemilogi. Ilma ketta enda aruandeta (SMART) ei saa seda terveks nimetada."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:198
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:199
msgid "%s%%"
msgstr "%s%%"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:198
msgid "It has used %s of the life its maker rates it for: it is near or past its end."
msgstr "See on kasutanud %s tootja määratud elueast: see on lõpu lähedal või sellest möödas."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:199
msgid "It has used %s of the life its maker rates it for."
msgstr "See on kasutanud %s tootja määratud elueast."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:200
msgid "Some of its SMART values were below their safe limit in the past."
msgstr "Mõned selle SMART-väärtused on varem olnud allpool ohutut piiri."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:205
msgid "It is hot now (%s °C). Heat shortens its life: give it air."
msgstr "See on praegu kuum (%s °C). Kuumus lühendab selle eluiga: taga sellele õhuvool."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:211
msgid "Critical: high risk for the data"
msgstr "Kriitiline: andmetele suur oht"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:212
msgid "Attention: needs a closer look"
msgstr "Tähelepanu: vajab lähemat uurimist"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:215
msgid "No alerts (SMART and system log checked)"
msgstr "Hoiatusi pole (SMART ja süsteemilogi kontrollitud)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:216
msgid "No alerts in the system log (SMART not read)"
msgstr "Süsteemilogis hoiatusi pole (SMART-i ei loetud)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:217
msgid "No alerts from SMART (system log not readable)"
msgstr "SMART-ist hoiatusi pole (süsteemilogi pole loetav)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:220
msgid "Not applicable (a disk image)"
msgstr "Ei kohaldu (kettatõmmis)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:221
msgid "Unknown: not enough information"
msgstr "Tundmatu: pole piisavalt teavet"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:229
msgid "The drive has sectors it can no longer read (%s pending), even if its overall verdict says PASSED."
msgstr "Kettal on sektoreid, mida see enam lugeda ei suuda (ootel: %s), isegi kui selle üldine hinnang on PASSED."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:230
msgid "The NVMe drive raised a critical warning (%s)."
msgstr "NVMe-ketas andis kriitilise hoiatuse (%s)."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:236
msgid "The drive already replaced damaged sectors with spare ones."
msgstr "Ketas on juba asendanud kahjustatud sektoreid varusektoritega."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:286
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:236
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Tüüp"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:287
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:240
msgid "Capacity"
msgstr "Mahutavus"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:293
msgid "SMART verdict"
msgstr "SMART-i hinnang"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:295
msgid "What was found:"
msgstr "Mida leiti:"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:299
msgid "Why it is not called healthy:"
msgstr "Miks seda terveks ei nimetata:"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:304
msgid "Volumes:"
msgstr "Köited:"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:313
msgid "no driver for this filesystem on this computer"
msgstr "selles arvutis pole selle failisüsteemi draiverit"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:315
msgid "writing blocked on the device"
msgstr "seadmesse kirjutamine on blokeeritud"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:321
msgid "For the SMART details of the drive, which need the administrator password: bigmount --drive diagnose DEVICE --smart"
msgstr "Ketta SMART-i üksikasjade jaoks, mis vajavad administraatori parooli: bigmount --drive diagnose SEADE --smart"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:331
msgid "Copy what matters now, starting with the most important files. Every extra read wears a failing disk."
msgstr "Kopeeri olulised asjad kohe, alustades kõige tähtsamatest failidest. Iga lisalugemine kulutab riknevat ketast."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:332
msgid "Do not run repair tools on this disk: they write, and they can destroy what is still readable."
msgstr "Ära käivita sellel kettal parandustööriistu: need kirjutavad ja võivad hävitada selle, mis on veel loetav."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:333
msgid "If the data is very important and cannot be replaced, consider a data recovery professional before insisting."
msgstr "Kui andmed on väga olulised ja asendamatud, kaalu enne edasist pingutamist andmete taastamise spetsialisti poole pöördumist."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:336
msgid "Copy your important files to another place."
msgstr "Kopeeri oma olulised failid teise kohta."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:337
msgid "Try another cable and connect the drive directly to the computer, without a hub."
msgstr "Proovi teist kaablit ja ühenda ketas otse arvutiga, ilma jaoturita."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:377
msgid "Permission to mount was not granted."
msgstr "Luba haakimiseks ei antud."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:379
msgid "Windows left this partition hibernated (Fast Startup). It can be read only after Windows shuts down completely."
msgstr "Windows jättis selle partitsiooni talveunerežiimi (kiirkäivitus). Seda saab lugeda alles pärast seda, kui Windows on täielikult välja lülitatud."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:380
msgid "The drive could not read the start of this filesystem. This is usually damage on the disk, a bad cable or a weak USB port. Making a disk image with GNU ddrescue is the safest next step."
msgstr "Ketas ei suutnud selle failisüsteemi algust lugeda. Tavaliselt on põhjuseks kahjustus kettal, halb kaabel või nõrk USB-port. Turvalisim järgmine samm on teha GNU ddrescue abil kettatõmmis."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:381
msgid "The structure of this filesystem seems damaged, or this is not the filesystem it claims to be. Nothing was repaired. A disk image or a search for files (PhotoRec) may still recover data."
msgstr "Selle failisüsteemi struktuur näib kahjustatud või pole see failisüsteem, mis ta väidab end olevat. Midagi ei parandatud. Kettatõmmis või failide otsing (PhotoRec) võib siiski andmeid taastada."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:382
msgid "This filesystem was not closed properly and needs to replay its journal, which writes to the disk. To protect the data that was not done. A disk image, worked on as a copy, is the safe way to read it."
msgstr "Seda failisüsteemi ei suletud korrektselt ja see peab oma žurnaali uuesti läbi mängima, mis kirjutab kettale. Andmete kaitseks seda ei tehtud. Turvaline viis selle lugemiseks on kettatõmmis, millega töötatakse koopiana."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:385
msgid "No filesystem was recognized on it. If it should have partitions, searching for them with TestDisk does not change the disk."
msgstr "Sellelt ei tuvastatud failisüsteemi. Kui sellel peaks olema partitsioone, siis nende otsimine TestDiskiga ketast ei muuda."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:388
msgid "This drive reported problems, so it is only mounted read-only. Writing to it can destroy what is still readable."
msgstr "See ketas teatas probleemidest, seega haagitakse see ainult lugemiseks. Sinna kirjutamine võib hävitada selle, mis on veel loetav."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:389
msgid "It is already mounted with writing enabled. Unmount it first to mount it read-only (bigmount --drive mount DEVICE --remount)."
msgstr "See on juba haagitud lugemiseks ja kirjutamiseks. Ainult lugemiseks haakimiseks haagi see esmalt lahti (bigmount --drive mount SEADE --remount)."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:390
msgid "It is in use, so it could not be unmounted to be mounted again."
msgstr "See on kasutusel, seega ei õnnestunud seda uuesti haakimiseks lahti haakida."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:391
msgid "Writing could not be blocked on the drive: another volume of it is mounted with writing enabled. Unmount it first."
msgstr "Kettale kirjutamist ei õnnestunud blokeerida: selle teine köide on haagitud lugemiseks ja kirjutamiseks. Haagi see esmalt lahti."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:392
msgid "Writing cannot be blocked on the drive of the running system, so the volume was not mounted."
msgstr "Töötava süsteemi kettale kirjutamist ei saa blokeerida, seega köidet ei haagitud."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-diag.sh:393
msgid "The reason could not be determined. Nothing was changed on the device. See the technical details."
msgstr "Põhjust ei õnnestunud kindlaks teha. Seadmes ei muudetud midagi. Vaata tehnilisi üksikasju."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-erase.sh:183
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-erase.sh:190
msgid "The confirmation is no longer valid. Nothing was erased. Start again."
msgstr "Kinnitus ei kehti enam. Midagi ei kustutatud. Alusta uuesti."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-erase.sh:195
msgid "The name did not match. Nothing was erased."
msgstr "Nimi ei ühtinud. Midagi ei kustutatud."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-erase.sh:237
msgid "Erasing it will stop these services:"
msgstr "Selle kustutamine peatab need teenused:"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:95
msgid "This image already exists. It continues where it stopped, reading only what is still missing."
msgstr "See tõmmis on juba olemas. See jätkab sealt, kus pooleli jäi, ja loeb ainult seda, mis veel puudub."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:96
msgid "Files found by content lose their original names and folders."
msgstr "Sisu järgi leitud failid kaotavad oma algsed nimed ja kaustad."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:97
msgid "This drive reported problems. Reading all of it can make it worse: the disk image is read only once, and only with your consent."
msgstr "See ketas teatas probleemidest. Kogu selle lugemine võib olukorda halvendada: kettatõmmise jaoks loetakse see ainult üks kord ja ainult sinu nõusolekul."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:98
msgid "Making the list goes through all the folders. On a drive with problems this is extra wear."
msgstr "Loendi koostamine käib läbi kõik kaustad. Probleemidega kettal tähendab see lisakulumist."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:99
msgid "This SSD erases deleted blocks by itself (TRIM). Files deleted some time ago may be gone for good, however deep the search."
msgstr "See SSD kustutab kustutatud plokid ise (TRIM). Mõni aeg tagasi kustutatud failid võivad olla jäädavalt kadunud, ükskõik kui põhjalik on otsing."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:205
msgid "Both --source DEVICE and --image FILE are needed."
msgstr "Vaja on nii --source SEADE kui ka --image FAIL."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:260
msgid "The image needs %s of free space at the destination."
msgstr "Tõmmis vajab sihtkohas vaba ruumi: %s."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:342
msgid "Photos"
msgstr "Fotod"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:343
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "Videod"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:344
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Dokumendid"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:345
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Heli"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:346
msgid "Compressed files"
msgstr "Tihendatud failid"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:347
msgid "Other files"
msgstr "Muud failid"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:355
msgid "HEIC and WebP photos are found only when searching all types."
msgstr "HEIC- ja WebP-fotod leitakse ainult kõigi tüüpide otsimisel."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:356
msgid "WAV audio can appear among the results: it has the same signature as AVI."
msgstr "Tulemuste hulgas võib olla WAV-helifaile: neil on sama signatuur kui AVI-failidel."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:357
msgid "AVI and WMV videos can appear among the results, and M4A audio is found only when searching all types."
msgstr "Tulemuste hulgas võib olla AVI- ja WMV-videoid ning M4A-helifailid leitakse ainult kõigi tüüpide otsimisel."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:358
msgid "Word, Excel and LibreOffice files share a signature with ZIP files, so those appear too."
msgstr "Wordi, Exceli ja LibreOffice'i failidel on ZIP-failidega sama signatuur, seega ilmuvad ka need."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:359
msgid "Word, Excel and LibreOffice files can appear among the results: they are ZIP files inside."
msgstr "Tulemuste hulgas võib olla Wordi, Exceli ja LibreOffice'i faile: need on seest ZIP-failid."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:551
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:903
msgid "Search started: %s"
msgstr "Otsing alustatud: %s"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:928
msgid "%s files found by content in %s. Their original names and folders could not be kept."
msgstr "Sisu järgi leitud faile: %s, asukohas %s. Nende algseid nimesid ja kaustu ei õnnestunud säilitada."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:937
msgid "Files listed:"
msgstr "Loetletud faile:"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:938
msgid "Files examined:"
msgstr "Uuritud faile:"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:941
msgid "Candidates found:"
msgstr "Leitud kandidaate:"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:945
msgid "Read:"
msgstr "Loetud:"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:958
msgid "Files listed"
msgstr "Loetletud failid"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:959
msgid "Files examined"
msgstr "Uuritud failid"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:960
msgid "These files exist on the volume. Files that were deleted are not on this list."
msgstr "Need failid on köites olemas. Kustutatud faile selles loendis pole."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:963
msgid "Candidates found"
msgstr "Leitud kandidaadid"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:964
msgid "Found by content: their original names and folders could not be kept, and some may be incomplete. Open them to check."
msgstr "Leitud sisu järgi: nende algseid nimesid ja kaustu ei õnnestunud säilitada ja mõned võivad olla puudulikud. Ava need kontrollimiseks."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:969
msgid "Could not be read:"
msgstr "Lugeda ei õnnestunud:"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:994
msgid "Only a list or a search has results."
msgstr "Tulemused on ainult loendil või otsingul."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:1013
msgid "The list is not ready yet."
msgstr "Loend pole veel valmis."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:1037
msgid "This command only answers with --json."
msgstr "See käsk vastab ainult valikuga --json."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:1115
msgid "This is a disk image: searching it does not touch any disk."
msgstr "See on kettatõmmis: selles otsimine ei puuduta ühtegi ketast."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:1119
msgid "The drive reported problems. For the whole drive, a disk image reads it only once. To copy files, choose one of its volumes."
msgstr "Ketas teatas probleemidest. Kogu ketta puhul loeb kettatõmmis selle ainult üks kord. Failide kopeerimiseks vali üks selle köidetest."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:1123
msgid "For the whole drive, files are searched by their content. To copy files, choose one of its volumes."
msgstr "Kogu ketta puhul otsitakse faile nende sisu järgi. Failide kopeerimiseks vali üks selle köidetest."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:1127
msgid "The drive reported problems: copy what matters first, without going through everything."
msgstr "Ketas teatas probleemidest: kopeeri esmalt olulised asjad, ilma kõike läbi käimata."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:1131
msgid "The drive reported problems and its files cannot be opened: a disk image reads it only once, and the search is done on the image."
msgstr "Ketas teatas probleemidest ja selle faile ei saa avada: kettatõmmis loeb selle ainult üks kord ja otsing tehakse tõmmises."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:1135
msgid "The files can be read normally: list them, and choose what to copy."
msgstr "Faile saab tavapäraselt lugeda: loetle need ja vali, mida kopeerida."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-recovery.sh:1139
msgid "The files cannot be opened normally: search for them by content."
msgstr "Faile ei saa tavapäraselt avada: otsi neid sisu järgi."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:112
msgid "Usage: bigmount --drive [COMMAND] [OPTIONS]"
msgstr "Kasutus: bigmount --drive [KÄSK] [VALIKUD]"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:113
msgid "Without a command: the interactive manager (needs a terminal)."
msgstr "Ilma käsuta: interaktiivne haldur (vajab terminali)."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:115
msgid "storage devices and what is known about their health"
msgstr "salvestusseadmed ja see, mida nende seisundi kohta teatakse"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:116
msgid "everything known about one drive"
msgstr "kõik, mida ühe ketta kohta teatakse"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:117
msgid "which drive a device, folder or UUID is"
msgstr "milline ketas on seade, kaust või UUID"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:118
msgid "explain its state; --smart also reads SMART (asks for a password)"
msgstr "selgita selle olekut; --smart loeb ka SMART-i (küsib parooli)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:119
msgid "mount a volume without changing it (the default)"
msgstr "haagi köide seda muutmata (vaikimisi)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:120
msgid "also block writing on the device itself (asks for a password)"
msgstr "blokeeri ka seadmesse endasse kirjutamine (küsib parooli)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:121
msgid "unmount first if it is mounted with writing enabled"
msgstr "haagi enne lahti, kui see on haagitud lugemiseks ja kirjutamiseks"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:122
msgid "mount with writing enabled (refused on a drive at risk)"
msgstr "haagi lugemiseks ja kirjutamiseks (ohus kettal keeldutakse)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:123
msgid "unmount one volume safely; a whole drive: all of its volumes"
msgstr "haagi üks köide turvaliselt lahti; terve ketta puhul kõik selle köited"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:124
msgid "unmount everything on the drive and power it off"
msgstr "haagi lahti kõik kettal olev ja lülita ketas välja"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:125
msgid "also stop the services that use it (asked first in the window)"
msgstr "peata ka seda kasutavad teenused (aknas küsitakse enne)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:126
msgid "which programs keep a volume busy, and which of them may be closed"
msgstr "millised programmid hoiavad köidet hõivatuna ja milliseid neist võib sulgeda"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:127
msgid "ask your programs that keep it busy to close (never the system, never one that is writing)"
msgstr "palu oma programmidel, mis seda hõivatuna hoiavad, sulguda (mitte kunagi süsteemil ega sellel, mis kirjutab)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:128
msgid "block or allow writing on the device (asks for a password)"
msgstr "blokeeri või luba seadmesse kirjutamine (küsib parooli)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:129
msgid "unlock an encrypted volume"
msgstr "ava krüpteeritud köite lukk"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:130
msgid "where files can be copied to"
msgstr "kuhu saab faile kopeerida"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:131
msgid "copy files in the background and follow the progress"
msgstr "kopeeri faile taustal ja jälgi edenemist"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:132
msgid "copy only this file or folder of the source (repeatable)"
msgstr "kopeeri allikast ainult see fail või kaust (korratav)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:133
msgid "copy the items listed in FILE, separated by NUL"
msgstr "kopeeri FILE-is loetletud üksused, eraldatud märgiga NUL"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:134
msgid "copy found files out of the folder of that search"
msgstr "kopeeri leitud failid selle otsingu kaustast välja"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:135
msgid "files that already exist: keep them (default), keep them aside, replace them"
msgstr "juba olemas olevad failid: jäta alles (vaikimisi), pane kõrvale, asenda"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:136
msgid "how to check the result (full reads the source again)"
msgstr "kuidas tulemust kontrollida (full loeb allika uuesti)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:137
msgid "set aside a file that does not advance for N seconds (default 90, 0: never)"
msgstr "pane kõrvale fail, mis ei liigu edasi N sekundit (vaikimisi 90, 0: mitte kunagi)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:138
msgid "limit the reading speed"
msgstr "piira lugemiskiirust"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:139
msgid "measure the total first (auto: not on a drive at risk)"
msgstr "mõõda enne kogumaht (auto: mitte ohus kettal)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:140
msgid "accept a destination on the same physical disk"
msgstr "aktsepteeri sihtkohta samal füüsilisel kettal"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:141
msgid "accept a drive at risk that is mounted with writing enabled"
msgstr "aktsepteeri ohus ketast, mis on haagitud lugemiseks ja kirjutamiseks"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:142
msgid "accept a destination on a drive with critical alerts"
msgstr "aktsepteeri sihtkohta kriitiliste hoiatustega kettal"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:143
msgid "start and return, the copy continues in the background"
msgstr "alusta ja naase, kopeerimine jätkub taustal"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:144
msgid "copies and images, running and past"
msgstr "koopiad ja tõmmised, töötavad ja varasemad"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:145
msgid "progress of one of them"
msgstr "ühe neist edenemine"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:146
msgid "stop it safely (it can be resumed later)"
msgstr "peata see turvaliselt (saab hiljem jätkata)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:147
msgid "continue it, also after a shutdown; optionally try what was set aside"
msgstr "jätka seda, ka pärast väljalülitamist; soovi korral proovi kõrvale pandut uuesti"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:148
msgid "report of a drive or of a copy (--output FILE [--replace])"
msgstr "ketta või koopia aruanne (--output FILE [--replace])"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:149
msgid "which ways of recovering files can be used on it, and which is advised"
msgstr "milliseid failide taastamise viise saab sellel kasutada ja milline on soovitatav"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:150
msgid "make a disk image with GNU ddrescue"
msgstr "tee kettatõmmis GNU ddrescue abil"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:151
msgid "read the partition table with TestDisk; --search also looks for lost ones. Nothing is changed"
msgstr "loe partitsioonitabelit TestDiskiga; --search otsib ka kadunud partitsioone. Midagi ei muudeta"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:152
msgid "list the files that exist in a folder, by type (not deleted ones)"
msgstr "loetle kaustas olemas olevad failid tüübi järgi (mitte kustutatuid)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:153
msgid "search for files by content with PhotoRec"
msgstr "otsi faile sisu järgi PhotoReci abil"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:154
msgid "only these types: photos,videos,documents,audio,archives (default: all)"
msgstr "ainult need tüübid: photos,videos,documents,audio,archives (vaikimisi: kõik)"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:155
msgid "what a search found"
msgstr "mida otsing leidis"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:156
msgid "whether Secure Erase can be used on a drive, and what would be lost"
msgstr "kas kettal saab kasutada käsku Secure Erase ja mis läheks kaotsi"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:157
msgid "machine-readable output"
msgstr "masinloetav väljund"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:158
msgid "say what would be done, change nothing"
msgstr "ütle, mida tehtaks, midagi muutmata"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:159
msgid "TARGET is a device (/dev/sdb1) or a folder inside a mounted device."
msgstr "TARGET on seade (/dev/sdb1) või kaust haagitud seadmes."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:200
msgid "bigmount: more than one device has this UUID: %s. Name the device."
msgstr "bigmount: seda UUID-d kasutab rohkem kui üks seade: %s. Anna seadme nimi."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:222
msgid "The list of devices could not be read."
msgstr "Seadmete loendit ei õnnestunud lugeda."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:237
msgid "Manufacturer"
msgstr "Tootja"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:238
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Mudel"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:243
msgid "Partition table"
msgstr "Partitsioonitabel"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:257
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Suurus"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:264
msgid "Space"
msgstr "Ruum"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:266
msgid "Writing"
msgstr "Kirjutamine"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:266
msgid "blocked on the device"
msgstr "seadmes blokeeritud"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:377
msgid "smartctl is not installed (package smartmontools), so SMART details cannot be read."
msgstr "smartctl pole paigaldatud (pakett smartmontools), seega SMART-i üksikasju ei saa lugeda."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:382
msgid "Permission to read SMART was not granted."
msgstr "Luba SMART-i lugemiseks ei antud."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:383
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-tui.sh:120
msgid "The drive did not report SMART data. Many USB adapters do not pass it through."
msgstr "Ketas ei andnud SMART-andmeid. Paljud USB-adapterid ei edasta neid."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:406
msgid "Mounted read-only at %s"
msgstr "Haagitud ainult lugemiseks asukohta %s"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:407
msgid "Mounted at %s"
msgstr "Haagitud asukohta %s"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:409
msgid "Writing is also blocked on the device itself until it is disconnected."
msgstr "Ka seadmesse endasse kirjutamine on blokeeritud, kuni see lahti ühendatakse."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:432
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:596
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:616
msgid "Name a device, such as /dev/sdb1."
msgstr "Anna seadme nimi, näiteks /dev/sdb1."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:504
msgid "Nothing was done. Use bigmount --unmount to confirm stopping them."
msgstr "Midagi ei tehtud. Nende peatamise kinnitamiseks kasuta käsku bigmount --unmount."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:602
msgid "Writing is now blocked on this device until it is disconnected."
msgstr "Sellesse seadmesse kirjutamine on nüüd blokeeritud, kuni see lahti ühendatakse."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:603
msgid "Writing is allowed on this device again."
msgstr "Sellesse seadmesse kirjutamine on taas lubatud."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:606
msgid "Another volume of this drive is mounted with writing enabled. Unmount it first."
msgstr "Selle ketta teine köide on haagitud lugemiseks ja kirjutamiseks. Haagi see esmalt lahti."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:607
msgid "Refused: this drive holds the running system."
msgstr "Keeldutud: sellel kettal on töötav süsteem."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:609
msgid "The helper failed (exit %s)."
msgstr "Abiprogramm nurjus (väljumiskood %s)."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:618
msgid "Unlocking in the terminal needs an interactive terminal."
msgstr "Terminalis luku avamine vajab interaktiivset terminali."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:679
msgid "bigmount: the graphical application does not run as administrator. Open it as your user; it asks for the password when it needs it."
msgstr "bigmount: graafiline rakendus ei tööta administraatorina. Ava see oma kasutajana; see küsib parooli, kui seda vajab."

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:683
msgid "bigmount: there is no graphical session here. Use the manager in the terminal: bigmount --drive"
msgstr "bigmount: siin pole graafilist seanssi. Kasuta terminalis haldurit: bigmount --drive"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:693
msgid "The application needs GTK 4, libadwaita 1.5 or later and PyGObject (packages gtk4, libadwaita and python-gobject). The same tools work in the terminal: bigmount --drive"
msgstr "Rakendus vajab GTK 4, libadwaita 1.5 või uuemat ja PyGObjecti (paketid gtk4, libadwaita ja python-gobject). Samad tööriistad töötavad terminalis: bigmount --drive"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive-tui.sh:35
